WEBVTT

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:19.680
Seven of us, eh?

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:23.950
More than enough. We have nothing to worry about.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.290
Now then, let us make sure we all know what our objectives are.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:33.230
First of all, we shall reclaim our comrades.

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:37.430
Secondly, we shall take over the Orbit Base...

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.870
...now occupied by the organization known as GGG.

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:47.040
Thirdly, the total annihilation of the Legacy of Cain and the Curse of Abel.

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:49.110
Very well.

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:01.720
7 Machine Primevals.

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:04.190
Joint operation.

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:09.160
Projected success rate, 99.97%.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:12.130
Uncertain elements, zero.

00:01:15.110 --> 00:01:16.000
It's the Primevals!

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:19.250
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:22.150
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:28.920
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:33.770
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:40.000
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:44.090
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:48.790
to save the future of outer space.

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:52.750
It's time to launch!

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:55.930
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:59.850
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:04.550
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:07.510
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:07.510 --> 00:02:10.430
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:13.180
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:13.390 --> 00:02:16.690
Pulverizing steel!

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:20.360
Goldion Hammer!

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:27.890
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:33.890
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:02:33.890 --> 00:02:36.710
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:40.890
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:44.830
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:47.880
The Seven Ultimate Machine Primevals

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:51.070
<i>The Seven Ultimate Machine Primevals</i>

00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:01.710
Oh, wow! What a big crowd!

00:03:01.850 --> 00:03:03.210
Hey, look over there, guys!

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.010
That's it! That's the one!

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:09.110
The pride of the U.S. Navy's Seventh Fleet!

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:11.720
The LHA 3 Belleau Wood!

00:03:11.890 --> 00:03:13.720
Third ship in the Tarawa class.

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:14.720
Total length...

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:20.560
...254 meters! Displacement, 39,967 tons!

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:23.090
Hey, you've really done your homework!

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:24.570
You, too, Big Sis!

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:25.620
All right!

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:33.180
Oh! Ayame-chan!

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:34.850
Geez!

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:37.570
I came because you told me it would be a fun event...

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:41.480
...but where's the fun in wandering around these ships that stink of oil?

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:50.090
Oh, well, since there's a lot of XGL B-Boys I can at least feast my eyes.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.820
XGL B-Boys?

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:54.520
Extremely Good Looking Blond Boys, of course!

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:58.630
Too bad, Mamoru should've come with us!

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:02.610
Well, he couldn't help it. He said he had something important to do.

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:05.770
You must be very lonely, not having your darling around, right, Hana?

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:08.040
Th-That's not true!

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:11.180
Okay, let's do it!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.610
Atomic Disassembly, begin!

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:20.020
Huh?

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:21.120
What's going on?

00:04:21.430 --> 00:04:22.760
What is all this, anyway?

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:24.530
M-My body!

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:26.950
I'm disappearing!

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:29.360
H-Help us!

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:31.900
Mamoru!

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:39.470
GaiGar here.

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:41.140
I'm unable to find my target!

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:43.040
The same goes for me.

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:44.980
I haven't found so much as a fragment.

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:48.780
24 hours have passed since the battleship mysteriously vanished...

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:54.160
...and despite GGG's search efforts, they have yet to obtain a single clue.

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:56.450
How on earth could 7 battleships...

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:59.120
...separated by this much distance all disappear at the same time?

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:03.500
On display as a war memorial at Pearl Harbor, the New Jersey...

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:08.390
In the Arctic Ocean, the Russian Navy's icebreaker, the Arktika...

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:11.340
On the Philippine coast, a major supplier ship...

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:15.010
In the Atlantic Ocean, the attack submarine, Trafalgar...

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:18.040
And in Yokosuka in Japan...

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:22.110
...the U.S. Navy's Belleau Wood and the carrier, USS Independence...

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:25.520
...as well as the Self-Defense Force's Kirishima all have vanished.

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:29.060
It's probably safe to assume that this is the Primevals' doing.

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:31.490
What can the enemy's objective be?

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:39.230
If only I'd been there too.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:44.240
I could've used the same powers as Kaidou!

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:45.970
Special Agent Mamoru...

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:49.170
...there's no use regretting what's already happened.

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:51.070
But...

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:55.910
I have suffered many regrets over not being able to save ChoRyuJin.

00:05:56.020 --> 00:06:00.010
But no amount of agonizing is going to bring ChoRyuJin back.

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:03.560
I guess you're right, Volfogg.

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:08.690
Right now, we've got to do what we can.

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:14.600
After all that searching, we're still without a clue, are we?

00:06:14.670 --> 00:06:16.660
It's a little disturbing that the enemy...

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:19.540
...hasn't made a single move since those 7 battleships disappeared.

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:21.810
There's nothing to worry about!

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:25.510
The Zonder Crystal analysis is proceeding as planned.

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:27.480
If the enemy shows up, it'll be their downfall.

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:30.110
We'll blast them to bits with the Solitary Wave!

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:34.220
They're on the move.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:35.760
Location?

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.550
In orbit, eh?

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:41.460
J-Ark, launch!

00:06:57.050 --> 00:07:00.410
Enemy detected at 12 o'clock! I'm putting it up on the main screen!

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:02.610
What's that?

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:07.590
Seven of them in all.

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:10.960
All of the missing battleships are gathered in that fleet.

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:14.490
But who would've thought they'd suddenly reappear right in front of us.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:17.720
There's no trace of an ES Window!

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:19.170
Hmm, but why?

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:22.500
Here it comes!

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:24.430
Protect Shade, switch on!

00:07:24.740 --> 00:07:25.610
Roger!

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.820
Did that leave the enemy unharmed?

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:49.970
We're not going to get anywhere this way.

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:52.660
Liger! Can we use the Solitary Wave?

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:56.340
It's no good. The enemy took action sooner than I'd anticipated.

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:58.070
I still don't have sufficient data!

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:00.110
Hmph! Pretty useless if you ask me!

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:02.300
I've got Stallion working on it right now!

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:04.180
I'm gonna go give him a hand!

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:07.150
Chief, I'm going out there as GaoGaiGar.

00:08:07.220 --> 00:08:09.120
Please release the PS System.

00:08:09.190 --> 00:08:10.080
Hold on!

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:12.850
The enemy's actions are way too simple.

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:14.910
I'm sure they've got some plot up their sleeve.

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:15.920
Huh?

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:29.770
Have you found an infiltration route?

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:33.700
There is a 0.02mm pinhole.

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:38.100
Intestine, you stay here to take care of that other operation.

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:42.450
Now then, let's move on to Phase 2.

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:45.210
Atom Disassembly, start!

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:09.240
Reverse!

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.620
That was too easy, huh?

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:19.850
No matter how fail-safe the protection...

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:21.980
...there is always at least an atom-sized crack.

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:25.420
There are Primevals really close!

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:28.990
W-What on earth is happening?

00:09:35.270 --> 00:09:36.900
This is Level 23.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:39.200
There's been an explosion of unknown cause!

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:50.410
What fragile creatures you are!

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:53.050
Nails, that's enough.

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:56.120
There's no sense in killing them off.

00:09:56.930 --> 00:09:57.790
Humans?

00:09:58.160 --> 00:09:59.190
They're Primevals!

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:00.350
Those people?

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.690
They've taken on human form, but they're not human!

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:06.630
But how did they break through the PS System and get inside?

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:09.040
Those rascals have astonishing powers!

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:11.500
Somewhere on the external wall of Level 23...

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:13.870
...there's a crack no more than 0.02mm...

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:17.000
...but it's still a crack unprotected by the PS System!

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:21.450
They must have broken down their bodies to the atomic level...

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:23.990
...and infiltrated through that crack. There's no other explanation!

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:26.160
Who would've thought they were capable of that?

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:36.890
Life forms, 12. Low-level weapons. Advancing even as we speak.

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:41.840
Time for Phase 3. As we discussed, we'll split up into 3 groups.

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:45.500
Ear and I will take the central area of this base.

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:48.970
Ribs and Liver, you'll destroy the Legacy of Cain.

00:10:49.050 --> 00:10:49.910
Right.

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:52.340
And you, Eyes, you come with me.

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:53.080
Roger.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:56.010
Where's the enemy!

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:01.320
Fire!

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:14.030
Are those the Primevals?

00:11:14.140 --> 00:11:15.570
But they look just like human beings!

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:19.270
You really think so?

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:27.680
A-Are you guys all right?

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:35.420
Oh, my, don't tell me you're actually going to shoot your comrades?

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:46.600
All right! You come over to our side, too!

00:11:50.840 --> 00:11:52.170
We won't let you get away!

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:53.570
Just let him go.

00:11:54.110 --> 00:11:58.240
Remember, our objective is to take over the nerve center of this base!

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:02.150
Now then, it's time to get this show on the road!

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:05.580
Level 20, the artificial gravity device is dead!

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:09.760
Atmospheric Circulation System, operational rate now down to 65%!

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:12.920
Are those villains planning to take over this Orbit Base?

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:17.660
No, we have the GS-Ride running in the main areas of the Orbit Base.

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:21.030
As long as the Zonder Metal-repelling G-Stone is in place...

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:23.340
...the enemy can't strike at will.

00:12:23.710 --> 00:12:27.640
Hold on a minute! The enemy has split up into groups of 3...

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:30.340
...one of which is now on the move towards Level 10!

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:33.580
What? That's the floor where my brother's research facilities are!

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:37.450
Are those Primevals after the Zonder Crystal!

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:39.280
Chief! I'm going to head out!

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:40.950
Primevals or not...

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:43.790
...if they're our size, then I've got a chance to take them on in battle!

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:45.820
Big Brother Gai, I'm coming with you!

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.150
Mamoru?

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:49.430
If I can purify those Primevals with my powers...

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:50.870
It's too dangerous!

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:52.990
It's not just one enemy this time.

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:54.300
Mamoru, I want you to stay there.

00:12:55.270 --> 00:12:57.040
You just wait, you damn Primevals!

00:12:58.810 --> 00:12:59.470
What's the matter?

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:02.870
A Cyborg is approaching from the upper level.

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:06.720
I'll have to eliminate the nuisance, then.

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:27.860
Enemy Group A...

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:31.960
They've hypnotized the agents and have arrived at Level 18!

00:13:32.340 --> 00:13:36.440
Enemy Group B is still advancing towards the Research Facilities.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:39.850
Enemy Group C is now advancing towards Amaterasu.

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:43.280
Level 22 out of commission due to air particles from the explosion.

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:45.510
Gai's location is unknown at this time.

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:47.950
Mamoru!

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.800
Although he is the most powerful cyborg known to mankind...

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:08.210
...he is still limited in his ability to survive in a vacuum.

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:11.640
Is this it for me, then?

00:14:29.230 --> 00:14:31.630
Who are you, anyway?

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:32.660
Why?

00:14:36.010 --> 00:14:37.410
Don't give up...

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:39.610
Is that what you're trying to tell me?

00:14:57.190 --> 00:14:58.460
She's smiling.

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:08.370
Where did she go?

00:15:12.940 --> 00:15:15.070
The cyborg is approaching from above!

00:15:15.150 --> 00:15:16.270
Hm? From outside?

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:21.880
Are you the 31 Machine Primevals?

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:25.520
Good job returning from the darkness of that vacuum...

00:15:25.590 --> 00:15:26.780
...Cyborg Gai.

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:28.960
So you know my name?

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:32.230
It's my turn now!

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:34.860
Will Knife!

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:38.870
How ridiculous!

00:15:57.620 --> 00:15:58.320
They're coming!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:08.230
What are you doing? Fire!

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:09.760
I thought respect for human life was...

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:11.820
...more important than destruction of the enemy!

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:12.890
What?

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:16.500
It appears that those Primevals have fused with human beings.

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:19.440
Even so, we've got to get rid of them or they'll get rid of us!

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:24.840
I see you're all here, FuRyu, RaiRyu, Goldymarg...

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:27.780
How come you know our names?

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:30.010
We know more than just your names.

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:34.180
Your functions, your weaponry... everything there is to know!

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:36.620
Looks like one's missing, eh?

00:16:37.230 --> 00:16:39.020
Well, it's not really important anyway.

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:41.830
That miscalculation will prove to be your downfall!

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:43.560
Are you Volfogg?

00:16:43.970 --> 00:16:46.060
Double Boomerang!

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:52.670
Nice going!

00:16:55.050 --> 00:16:57.100
Reverse!

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:03.080
My power happens to be regeneration and recovery.

00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:06.680
Even if a substance has been broken down to its atomic level...

00:17:06.760 --> 00:17:08.690
...I can restore it to its original form!

00:17:09.060 --> 00:17:11.250
Atomic-level reconstruction?

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:18.730
Didn't I just tell you? We already know what your powers are.

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:20.130
Curse those two!

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:21.360
Volfogg...

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:24.770
Sorry, but even those boomerangs of yours at maximum power...

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:28.500
...the Silver Cross will have zero effect on us!

00:17:29.050 --> 00:17:31.210
In that case, allow me to at least try!

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:33.940
Atom Disassembly!

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:40.290
Even with its Mirror-Coating, the Silver Cross...

00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:44.720
My power is Atom Disassembly.

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:48.460
The power to transform all materials into miniscule dust particles.

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:57.340
By using my power, without even touching the G-Stone...

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:59.970
...we can disassemble you all!

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:12.220
Tell me, how did you like my Superdirective Gravity Wave...

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:13.650
...Cyborg Gai?

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:16.580
I'm not done yet!

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:18.790
You're just wasting our time.

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:21.090
You'll have to disappear now, I'm afraid.

00:18:25.970 --> 00:18:26.830
A missile?

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:41.680
This is yet another way to use an ES Missile!

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:44.380
You're...

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:46.120
Soldato-J!

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:49.020
I thought you would show up eventually, Soldato.

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:51.090
It's just like the last time we met.

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:54.830
The last attack launched by the Trinary Solar System.

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:58.120
The time we soldiers of the skies...

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:01.970
...engaged you Primevals in hand-to-hand combat.

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:08.810
I never dreamed we'd be reunited here at the far ends of the galaxy!

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:11.240
It's quite fortunate for me.

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:15.270
I have unfinished business as a warrior to take care of right now!

00:19:19.920 --> 00:19:20.450
To your right.

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:28.900
You dodged me?

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:33.570
My powers are long-distance detection and future prediction.

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:38.000
No matter how swift your actions, they can be dodged if anticipated.

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:40.030
Is that what's going on, then?

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:41.900
Just hold on a minute!

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:44.480
Two against one is unfair, don't you think?

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:47.640
I don't need your help! You can just lie there!

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:51.050
Are you crazy? Who said I'd ever help the likes of you?

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:54.720
Hyper Mode!

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:03.100
This is my battle to fight!

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:04.860
It has nothing to do with you!

00:20:05.940 --> 00:20:07.160
How dare you act out of line!

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:13.540
J and G. This fist of mine will eliminate them both!

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:21.580
Galeon!

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:23.510
There's something I need you to do for me!

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:26.950
I want you to fight with me!

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:35.220
All operators are to evacuate to Area A7! Hurry!

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:37.930
The enemy has split up into 3 groups.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:40.130
One group is after the Zonder Crystal.

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:43.560
Another group's objective is to destroy the Brave Robots.

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:46.310
And therefore, the last group's objective must be...

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:48.940
Control of this base, that's what!

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:53.810
P-Primevals?

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:58.750
We're going to turn this base into a Zonder Metal Plant in space!

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:02.680
And then we're going to release Zonder spores containing...

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:05.320
...the Elementary Particle ZO all over Earth!

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:07.000
Z-Zonder spores?

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:11.990
Those things Gai saw inside the EI-09 cloud?

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:15.800
When those Zonders reach full maturity...

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:19.930
...they'll turn into Zonder spore-emitting nurseries, you see!

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:23.410
If the planet is hit by Elementary Particle ZO...

00:21:23.480 --> 00:21:27.110
...not only mankind, but all living creatures on Earth will perish.

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:29.040
Don't you worry about a thing.

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.280
Extinction is the fate of civilization!

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:32.450
Miss Swan!

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:33.750
Go!

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:43.590
All bulkheads, emergency shutdown! Hurry!

00:21:43.670 --> 00:21:44.260
Roger!

00:21:51.340 --> 00:21:52.140
What?

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:56.170
You see, this one's nails can slice through any material!

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:58.270
It's no use trying to escape!

00:21:59.820 --> 00:22:03.720
Now then, sit back and submit to your destiny!

00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:12.050
No!

00:22:27.710 --> 00:22:28.740
This can't be!

00:22:29.710 --> 00:22:31.870
Oh my, I know this human.

00:22:32.050 --> 00:22:34.350
Who cares? I'm gonna get her!

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:40.890
Gai...

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:50.370
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:55.240
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:01.420
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:06.210
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:10.380
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:17.310
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:24.070
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:28.730
...let's believe in them now.

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:34.070
When you and I are grown up

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:41.070
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:44.590 --> 00:23:47.560
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:47.920 --> 00:23:51.190
The 7 Ultimate Machine Primevals have taken over the Orbit Base...

00:23:51.260 --> 00:23:56.390
...and have put their extreme plan to destroy all of Earth into motion.

00:23:56.830 --> 00:23:58.200
Mamoru and Kaidou.

00:23:58.270 --> 00:24:01.640
The fate of the galaxy is on the line and now the burning saga...

00:24:01.700 --> 00:24:03.870
...is on its way towards its conclusion!

00:24:04.270 --> 00:24:06.270
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:06.250
Children of the Stars

00:24:06.340 --> 00:24:07.670
"Children of the Stars"

00:24:07.740 --> 00:24:10.910
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:11.900 --> 00:24:14.910
Div. 1 Izanagi

00:24:12.750 --> 00:24:14.380
This is the Key to Victory!
